01:00:05,185 --> 01:00:07,395
- How?
- Yes, how.

806
01:00:11,608 --> 01:00:13,318
HAPPY BIRTHDAY, NAM DA-REUM

807
01:00:30,043 --> 01:00:31,252
Let's get a pastry.

808
01:00:31,253 --> 01:00:32,545
- I'll buy you one.
- Great.

809
01:00:32,546 --> 01:00:33,588
- You will?
- Yes.

810
01:00:34,047 --> 01:00:35,590
Can I eat more than one?

811
01:00:39,469 --> 01:00:42,138
What were you like
in high school, Chan?

812
01:00:42,139 --> 01:00:43,306
In high school?

813
01:00:45,350 --> 01:00:48,185
I didn't stand out. I was quiet.

814
01:00:48,186 --> 01:00:51,940
Before I knew it, I was invisible.

815
01:00:53,567 --> 01:00:55,569
People acted like I wasn't there

816
01:00:55,944 --> 01:00:58,738
and that was harder
than actually being bullied.

817
01:00:59,114 --> 01:01:01,366
If someone had said
just one word to me

818
01:01:01,825 --> 01:01:03,493
going to school would've hurt less.

819
01:01:11,418 --> 01:01:14,546
If anyone out there
is going through the same thing

820
01:01:15,755 --> 01:01:16,882
I hope they remember this.

821
01:01:18,967 --> 01:01:20,552
You may feel alone right now

822
01:01:21,928 --> 01:01:23,430
but someone will appear one day

823
01:01:24,139 --> 01:01:25,307
to love you.

824
01:01:27,309 --> 01:01:28,476
They did for me.

825
01:01:31,229 --> 01:01:32,355
Until then

826
01:01:34,191 --> 01:01:35,817
I want to tell them to hang in there.

827
01:01:37,277 --> 01:01:38,653
That's my message.

828
01:02:05,680 --> 01:02:06,723
Hi.

829
01:02:14,314 --> 01:02:17,317
Do you like D.N.X too?

830
01:02:22,155 --> 01:02:23,198
Yes.

831
01:02:24,449 --> 01:02:26,701
Nice to meet you, comrade.

832
01:02:28,370 --> 01:02:29,704
Okay, so...

833
01:02:30,413 --> 01:02:32,040
My D.N.X bias

834
01:02:32,999 --> 01:02:35,167
is Roy. Who is your favorite?

835
01:02:35,168 --> 01:02:37,295
Just so you know, I love Hyeok.

836
01:02:40,298 --> 01:02:41,341
My bias

837
01:02:42,092 --> 01:02:43,134
is Lee Chan.

838
01:02:43,385 --> 01:02:45,761
- It's Lee Chan.
- We don't overlap.

839
01:02:45,762 --> 01:02:47,680
That's why you have his merch.

840
01:02:47,681 --> 01:02:51,016
Hey, isn't this really rare?

841
01:02:51,017 --> 01:02:52,852
Can I have a look?

842
01:02:55,397 --> 01:02:57,857
- Yes.
- Oh, wow. Thanks.

843
01:02:59,901 --> 01:03:01,152
- Look!
- It's so cute.

844
01:03:01,820 --> 01:03:04,321
It's so cute.

845
01:03:04,322 --> 01:03:06,074
My gosh. It's adorable.

846
01:03:06,908 --> 01:03:09,077
Look at this. I wish I had this.

847
01:03:11,204 --> 01:03:15,292
They are my best friends to this day.

848
01:03:19,921 --> 01:03:21,298
That must've been so tough.

849
01:03:25,051 --> 01:03:29,639
Your songs got me
through my worst times.

850
01:03:29,889 --> 01:03:32,808
And they brought
my best friends to me

851
01:03:32,809 --> 01:03:35,228
so I could enjoy
the rest of high school.

852
01:03:35,812 --> 01:03:36,813
That's why

853
01:03:38,148 --> 01:03:39,941
I'm always grateful to you.

854
01:03:45,405 --> 01:03:46,614
You held up well.

855
01:03:48,283 --> 01:03:49,326
And grew up well.

856
01:04:04,215 --> 01:04:05,300
But

857
01:04:06,301 --> 01:04:07,385
is that it?

858
01:04:08,428 --> 01:04:10,096
There could be other reasons.

859
01:04:10,472 --> 01:04:13,308
My good looks. My cool persona.

860
01:04:13,600 --> 01:04:14,892
My charms.

861
01:04:14,893 --> 01:04:16,353
That's a give...

862
01:04:18,646 --> 01:04:19,898
It's a given.

863
01:04:21,816 --> 01:04:25,152
There's no one else like you
with such perfect looks

864
01:04:25,153 --> 01:04:26,780
and a great character.

865
01:04:28,073 --> 01:04:29,949
That's what I'm like on TV.

866
01:04:31,701 --> 01:04:33,328
I could be completely different.

867
01:04:35,455 --> 01:04:37,082
I could be fake.

868
01:04:38,416 --> 01:04:39,834
I could be a hypocrite.

869
01:04:42,087 --> 01:04:45,006
You are a good person.

870
01:04:50,095 --> 01:04:53,473
I adored you for 12 years.
I can tell that much.

871
01:04:56,434 --> 01:04:59,562
If you tried to be
a good person so far

872
01:05:00,772 --> 01:05:03,858
that alone makes you a good person.

873
01:05:10,198 --> 01:05:12,199
Long-standing fans are grateful

874
01:05:12,200 --> 01:05:15,078
that you didn't get into any trouble.

875
01:05:15,245 --> 01:05:19,582
You didn't drink and drive or gamble.

876
01:05:21,459 --> 01:05:22,502
I mean it.

877
01:05:23,962 --> 01:05:27,966
I'm really so proud of you.

878
01:05:29,300 --> 01:05:31,010
Are you? Thanks.

879
01:05:40,270 --> 01:05:41,271
Thank you.

880
01:06:04,878 --> 01:06:07,296
No, it's not messy. I was gentle.

881
01:06:07,297 --> 01:06:08,630
Are you sure?

882
01:06:08,631 --> 01:06:09,716
I'll do it.

883
01:06:09,924 --> 01:06:11,092
It's better.

884
01:06:15,597 --> 01:06:17,182
I had it taken care of.

885
01:06:20,602 --> 01:06:22,270
- Chan.
- What?

886
01:06:23,062 --> 01:06:24,606
Keep it a secret that I'm your fan.

887
01:06:24,898 --> 01:06:27,150
- All of a sudden?
- Please...

888
01:06:28,860 --> 01:06:30,028
Then grant me a wish.

889
01:06:30,236 --> 01:06:33,072
What? Okay, fine, whatever.

890
01:06:35,408 --> 01:06:37,660
I'll think of a wish, Da-reum.

891
01:06:40,872 --> 01:06:41,956
Okay?

892
01:06:49,464 --> 01:06:50,507
"Da-reum"?

893
01:07:10,693 --> 01:07:14,614
MY BIAS, MY BOSS

894
01:07:25,792 --> 01:07:27,918
EPILOGUE

895
01:07:27,919 --> 01:07:29,003
Hey, Chan.

896
01:07:29,420 --> 01:07:31,672
We got the theme for the photoshoot.

897
01:07:31,673 --> 01:07:32,839
I'm tired.

898
01:07:32,840 --> 01:07:33,967
Don't you need a look?

899
01:07:34,968 --> 01:07:37,177
These are the questions for when

900
01:07:37,178 --> 01:07:39,388
- you meet your fans...
- Later.

901
01:07:39,389 --> 01:07:40,390
Okay.

902
01:07:42,934 --> 01:07:45,520
- If you're in a bad mood...
- I'm tired and you're noisy.

903
01:07:50,567 --> 01:07:54,112
I think an actor
should check this out.

904
01:07:54,529 --> 01:07:56,155
That would help.

905
01:07:56,656 --> 01:07:58,992
That's how you become successful.

906
01:08:03,788 --> 01:08:05,039
FASHION SHOW IS ON

907
01:08:06,749 --> 01:08:07,792
AS PLANNED

908
01:08:11,296 --> 01:08:14,591
- Hey.
- What is it?

909
01:08:16,092 --> 01:08:17,260
Let's film a challenge video.

910
01:08:18,011 --> 01:08:20,388
You just said you were tired.

911
01:08:20,888 --> 01:08:23,307
- We must do it now.
- Right now?

912
01:08:23,308 --> 01:08:27,061
Action. One, two, three.

913
01:08:28,605 --> 01:08:30,314
You're moving way too fast.

914
01:08:30,315 --> 01:08:32,233
Slow down.

915
01:08:39,616 --> 01:08:41,743
Let's try that once more.

916
01:08:43,369 --> 01:08:44,454
Let's do this.

917
01:08:46,331 --> 01:08:47,456
SPECIAL THANKS TO CHANG HYAE-JIN,
HUR JUNG-DO, AN YOUNG-MI

918
01:08:47,457 --> 01:08:50,168
Don't be so weak.
You're carrying your Chan.

919
01:08:50,793 --> 01:08:51,836
Are you jealous?

920
01:08:52,503 --> 01:08:54,797
We're at work.
I'm worried people will talk.

921
01:08:55,506 --> 01:08:57,966
A date? What should I do?

922
01:08:57,967 --> 01:09:00,511
Is it a gift for someone you like?

923
01:09:01,763 --> 01:09:03,138
Let's go to my place.

924
01:09:03,139 --> 01:09:05,183
Will you go as a woman or as a fan?

925
01:09:07,352 --> 01:09:08,728
No! Ms. Nam!

926
01:09:09,103 --> 01:09:11,230
That she likes me.

927
01:09:11,773 --> 01:09:12,940
A head-on

928
01:09:14,150 --> 01:09:15,276
romance?
